                                text: "V t\xe9to kapitole V\xe1m pop\xed\u0161eme navigaci na jednotliv\xfdch str\xe1nk\xe1ch funkc\xed (topn\xfd okruh, TUV, bivalence apod.). D\xe1le V\xe1m tak\xe9 p\u0159ibl\xed\u017e\xedme ovl\xe1d\xe1n\xed jednotliv\xfdch komponent webov\xe9ho prost\u0159ed\xed (tla\u010d\xedtka, ukazatele teplot apod.)."
